# Snow Commander target inventory
#
# One hostname or IP per line. Blank lines and # comments are ignored.
# Copy to a real file (for example ./inventory), which .gitignore excludes.
#
# Every host must be:
#   * an Enterprise Linux derivative - RHEL, CentOS, Rocky, AlmaLinux, Oracle
#   * EL7, EL8, EL9 or EL10
#   * x86_64 or aarch64  (note: no EL7 aarch64 Falcon sensor is published)
#   * reachable over SSH from the control plane
#   * configured with passwordless sudo for the deployment user
#
# Packages are chosen per host from its detected platform, so a mixed-version,
# mixed-architecture inventory is fine in a single run.

rhel9-np-01.strykercorp.com
rhel9-np-02.strykercorp.com

# Production - deploy only after a clean plan and verify on non-production
# rhel9-prod-01.strykercorp.com
# rhel10-prod-01.strykercorp.com
# rhel8-prod-07.strykercorp.com
